  "deviations": [
    "Default port 8912 was already bound by an unrelated pre-existing process at capture time, so this evidence was captured on an ephemeral port. The documented default is unchanged.",
    "preview/directions/a-plus.html runs an IntersectionObserver carousel that auto-advances every 2600 ms, so its screenshots are not byte-reproducible. Each capture records carouselState and carouselSelected; both runs were captured at MAP/step 0 because the section is out of view at scroll position 0.",
    "The page carries a loading=\"lazy\" image below the fold that captureBeyondViewport alone leaves blank. The harness sweeps the document and returns to the top before capturing; readiness stages in dom-metadata.json record that every image reached complete.",
    "The only HTTP error and the only console error in the capture is Chrome's automatic /favicon.ico request returning 404. The repository has no favicon and the page does not reference one; no page asset failed to load.",
    "9 placeholder links (href=\"#\") remain in this design-direction preview. Out of P0 scope; recorded for the package that owns navigation."
  ],
